WEBVTT

00:00.440 --> 00:01.840
Your son

00:01.920 --> 00:04.240
Does have some personal acquaintance with this man

00:04.320 --> 00:05.720
A pedantic scholar

00:06.520 --> 00:07.840
As if only he has a mouth

00:07.920 --> 00:09.480
As if only he is a parent official

00:09.560 --> 00:10.720
Living on my salary

00:10.800 --> 00:11.840
Cursing heaven and earth

00:11.920 --> 00:13.200
Even dares to curse me

00:13.280 --> 00:14.640
Such a man rushing to be reborn

00:14.800 --> 00:16.560
Could mix with you

00:16.800 --> 00:18.160
Your son is terrified

